# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (which is gitignored) and paste your key, to test Claude-guided
# extraction locally with `npx wrangler dev`. For the deployed Worker, set it as a secret instead:
#   npx wrangler secret put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
# Without a key, the app still works — it just falls back to its own cut-out.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here
